## What this licence does not cover

**The input data is not in this repository and is not ours to license.** Each source carries
its own terms, which travel with the data rather than with this repository, and anyone
reproducing the study takes them on directly:

| Source | Licence |
|---|---|
| Zenodo `10.5281/zenodo.10397664`, per-gauge metrics and metadata | CC BY 4.0 |
| WorldPop, 100 m | CC BY 4.0 |
| GHS-POP R2023A | CC BY 4.0 |
| HydroBASINS and HydroSHEDS | see the technical documentation supplied with the release |
| OpenStreetMap, via Geofabrik | ODbL |
| geoBoundaries | CC BY 4.0 |

**The OpenStreetMap obligation is the one to watch**, because ODbL is a share-alike licence for
databases, so anyone who publishes a derived database containing the OSM-derived feature counts
in `03-harness/03_add_osm.py` may incur share-alike obligations that this licence neither grants
nor removes. Our own published outputs will state which columns are OSM-derived so that a
reuser can see exactly what is affected.
